{"id":"vod_jy_44299","vodId":"44299","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"龙与虎","name_cn":"龙与虎","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第26集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/e13538a1556c413f59514438a436b1fa.jpg"},"summary":"新的学期开始了，外表凶狠但内心纯良的少年高须龙儿（间岛淳司 配音）决心利用重新分班的机会一扫往日同学对他的误解。更让他高兴的是，自己即将和暗恋了一年有余的栉枝实乃梨（堀江由衣 配音）成为同班同学。除此之外，还有多年的死党北村祐作（野岛裕史 配音）陪伴，一段崭新的高中生活展现在了龙儿的眼前。少女逢坂大河（钉宫理惠 配音）的出现吸引了龙儿的目光，并不是因为此人傲娇腹黑的别扭个性，而是因为在偶然中，龙儿发现，大河居然暗恋着自己的好友祐作。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-12 20:10:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbkK275b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbq5QlGb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9av5QQXe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3v66xd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBprPNa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Pe9B99Za/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbkK2rEb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbm6qqrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/wdLDZvAd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRnlPKd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7z9prd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Qe1q6GPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbWvPPva/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBpPLoa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRnPowd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9av58gne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbm6Yw3d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbq5l77b/ind